# 🎓 EduTrack — Student Management System

✨ **Smart • Simple • Efficient** ✨

A web-based application designed to simplify student record and academic management.

🌐 **Live Demo:** https://sanjanabejjanki07-art.github.io/EduTrack-Student-Management-System/

---

## 🌟 Features

- 📊 **Dashboard** — View student statistics and summaries.
- 👩‍🎓 **Student Management** — Add, edit, delete, search, and manage student records.
- 📅 **Attendance Management** — Track attendance and view summaries.
- 📚 **Academic Records** — Manage student marks and grades.
- 🏫 **Courses & Departments** — Organize academic information.
- 💰 **Fee Management** — Track student fee details.
- 🔔 **Notifications** — View important updates.
- 📈 **Reports** — Generate reports and export data.
- ⚙️ **Settings** — Customize application preferences.
- 🎨 **Interactive UI** — Enjoy a user-friendly interface.

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- 🌐 HTML5
- 🎨 CSS3
- ⚡ JavaScript
- 💾 Local Storage
- 📄 CSV Import & Export
- 🚀 GitHub Pages

---

## 🚀 Getting Started

**1. Clone the repository**

    git clone https://github.com/sanjanabejjanki07-art/EduTrack-Student-Management-System.git

**2. Open the project folder** in your code editor.

**3. Open `index.html`** in your browser.

🎉 You're ready to explore EduTrack!

---

## 💾 Data Storage

EduTrack may use browser Local Storage to save information, depending on the implementation.

⚠️ Data stored locally in a browser is not automatically shared between users or devices. Avoid entering real or sensitive student information.

